  <h3 id="author">Author</h3>

  Uberto Barbini is a passionate, pragmatic programmer and longtime
advocate of TDD and Extreme Programming. He&rsquo;s worked with many
languages, but favors Kotlin for its clarity and Python for its
simplicity. Today, he helps teams integrate AI assistants into their
workflows. He&rsquo;s an international speaker and the author of several books
and open source libraries.

